From ef1136f2a4a709b5cbc3d5f8f12064adb4039f23 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jelle Jassies <jellejassies@outlook.com>
Date: Sun, 5 Apr 2026 23:23:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] feat: add real DC stats - missed packets, TX/RX counters,
 sample rate/encoding responses

- Track late/missed packets per RX flow (latency > budget) via AtomicU32
  in SocketData/FlowInfo; report real counts in 0x8004 heartbeat block
- Track TX/RX byte counts (AtomicU64) and error counts (AtomicU32) in
  FlowsTransmitter/FlowsReceiver; report bytes/sec in 0x8000 utilization block
- Wire all 4 counter Arcs through DeviceServer -> info_mcast_server,
  FlowsReceiver::start(), FlowsTransmitter::start()
- Add send_sample_rate(): responds to DC opcode 0x81 with 44100/48000/88200/96000
- Add send_encoding(): responds to DC opcode 0x83 with 16/24/32-bit depth entries

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
